{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帝一の國ブログ、更新しました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古場の様子など色々載っています。\n良かったら読んで下さい♪\nhttp://yaplog.jp/teiichi/archive/245"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ今、舞妓Haaaan!!! 観ながら\nこれ書いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞妓さん素敵だなあ、可愛いなあ、素敵だなあ、素敵だなあ\n素敵だなあ、を3回言いました！\n日本に生まれて良かった〜\\( ˆoˆ )/神様有難うどす！\n７はーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日は、そんな京都にて握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は、ちーちゃんとペア"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんは、優しくて大人っぽくて、年下だけどお母さんみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めてお誕生日おめでとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんも、ちーちゃんのファンの皆さんも有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会も有難うございました〜(＊´◇`＊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：WILLSELECTION"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：GU\n左"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：Heather"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステ、有難うございました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲、｢ハルジオンが咲く頃｣\n地上波初披露でした。\n衣装にはハルジオンの刺繍がされています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/01/4398280/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このハルジオンという花、清浄な空気の中で育つと、花びらが紫になるらしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく見ると、この刺繍も紫が入っています。乃木坂カラーだね！はは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニチアサクラスタァ！！！\n2.5次元、特撮を地上波で語らせて頂けてこの上なく嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"